      "name": "Omni-scramblers",
      "rules": "In your Shooting phase, you can select one <b>visible</b> enemy unit within 18\" of this unit. That unit is <b>detected</b>:\\r<ul><li>While a unit is <b>detected</b>, that unit has +3\" <b>detection range</b>.</li></ul>",
