                    "rules": "Units containing one or more models with a <b>[CLOSE‑QUARTERS]</b> weapon can shoot using <b>close‑quarters shooting</b> (10.06).\\n\\nWhen using another <b>shooting type</b>, for each model in that unit (excluding <b>MONSTER/VEHICLE</b> models), you can only select <u>one</u> of the following to make attacks with:<ul><li>One or more of its <b>[CLOSE‑QUARTERS]</b> weapons.</li><li>One or more of its other ranged weapons.</li></ul>"
